# Build context for docker/render-worker.Dockerfile, the repository's one image. The same list
# sits beside the Dockerfile for BuildKit (<Dockerfile>.dockerignore); the classic builder reads this one.
# The install runs inside the image, so nothing installed or derived on the host is copied.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.output
**/.turbo
**/.tanstack
**/.nitro
**/.vercel
.turboslide
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
apps/studio/src/routeTree.gen.ts
.env
**/*.local
